{"time": 1757254096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "777315572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "虽然是山路，但是好歹是压得平坦的土路，近几天没有下雨，所以并不比神社难走"}
{"time": 1757254177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1836407384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "约半小时后，你来到天文台门口，附近一个游客也没有"}
{"time": 1757254200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539335234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "反常的是，明明不是休息日，天文台的大门也关着"}
{"time": 1757254272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1185679672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃尝试打开大门"}
{"time": 1757254299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "199310126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "门关着"}
{"time": 1757254331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "302065755", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃看看附近有无工作人员"}
{"time": 1757254360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "853033551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "就在你思索的刹那，余光中不知何时出现了一名蓝发少女"}
{"time": 1757254381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1342688489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "她缓缓开口道：“你是来找人的吗？”"}
{"time": 1757254419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1903612687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“是啊，你怎么知道？”＃好奇的看向她，脸上露出自己的营业笑容"}
{"time": 1757254459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "176680406", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“因为我也是来找人的。”"}
{"time": 1757254466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "617038069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“门，打不开吗？”"}
{"time": 1757254523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2122462417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“那看来我们还挺有缘分……刚刚试了，门开不了”＃回答的同时尝试用心理学辨认对方是否说谎"}
{"time": 1757254561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1932105074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "你没由来地感觉她的话十分可信"}
{"time": 1757254594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1483619161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”我可以帮你开门，但是，你要答应我一个请求“"}
{"time": 1757254613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "182795493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“你说说看？”"}
{"time": 1757254628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "86881528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "＃好奇对方会怎么把门打开"}
{"time": 1757254663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "518314623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”帮我进去找一个人，把它带出来，仅此而已“"}
{"time": 1757254734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "706439498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“你说的人该不会是雾雨铃吧……”＃打着哈哈，“你为什么不自己进去找呢？”"}
{"time": 1757254788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "443168723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”因为我进不去，但是你可以。我想不管怎样，你都可以帮助到我“"}
{"time": 1757254824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1722685961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "说罢，她拿出一把晶莹剔透的银色钥匙，在天文台的大门前点了一下"}
{"time": 1757254836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1462508114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“好了，你可以进去了”"}
{"time": 1757254840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2119058989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "随后……"}
{"time": 1757254844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1215530284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“没问题，告诉我你要找的人是谁？”＃发现对方身份特殊，摆出恭敬的姿态"}
{"time": 1757254851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688583109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（过一个灵感）"}
