{"time": 1757254928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1843968625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "仅仅是一瞬间，好像有一个巨大而深邃的球体在眼前晃了一下，随即消失，刚才的人也一同消失不见"}
{"time": 1757254969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1491631016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1055214585", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "（我场外问一句，你玩过人格解体吗？）"}
